@startuml
title MCP Runtime Recovery and Pinning Checkpoint

skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false

node "WSL2: Ubuntu-TF" as UTF {
  folder "terraform-openwebui" as TF
  component "Terraform" as Terraform
}

node "Docker Desktop" as Docker {
  component "open-webui-tf\n:3001 -> :8080\nhealthy" as OWUI
  component "Omelas-MCP-RW\n:8765 -> :8000\nrecovered baseline" as BASE
  component "Pinned candidate\n:8766 -> :8000\nvalidation only" as TEST
}

node "WSL2: Ubuntu" as U {
  folder "governed-mcp-runtime" as GMR
  folder "awake-in-omelas" as OML
}

artifact "Pinned build inputs" as PINS {
  node:22.23.2-bookworm-slim
  amd64 digest pinned
  mcpo==0.0.20
  mcp==1.28.1
  server-filesystem==2026.8.31
}

TF --> Terraform
Terraform --> OWUI : manage / recover

GMR --> BASE : governed launcher
GMR --> TEST : candidate validation
BASE --> OML : RW mount\n/workspace/omelas
TEST --> OML : RW mount\n/workspace/omelas
PINS --> TEST : build

note bottom of BASE
Known-good runtime retained
while pinned candidate was tested.
end note

note bottom of TEST
Behavior matched baseline:
OpenAPI 0.2.0
uid/gid 1001:1001
stdio filesystem server
end note
@enduml
